                            <comment id="14938203" author="ashutak" created="Wed, 30 Sep 2015 18:15:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Ignite.affinity(...) can be called for cache nonexistent cache. As a result a call to any method of the affinity will produce NPE.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Fix proposal:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;return special value and empty arrays/collections in this case&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;update javadoc for these goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
